            // For only-matching truncation: if pattern is ghp etc with 36 exact, we may need to truncate to minimal length
            // But our regex with {36,} will give longer match; to emulate original truncation to 36, we should truncate to 36 for those patterns
            // Let's handle truncation for known patterns
            truncated := m
